      "source": {
        "note": "The top of the dial: 100 µF, the largest value a multilayer ceramic of this kind is commonly made in (a 1210 case). It is the end of the knob, a specification of the range the part comes in rather than a rating, which is why it is a parameter and not in \"limits\"."
